  "description": "NORNOZ01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H78 Cl4 Ho8 N28 O16. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho3A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.708-3.842 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.32-111.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H84Cl4Ho8N28O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies S(I).",
